         <gmd:abstract>
            <gco:CharacterString>Landslide inventory of 14 earthquake affected prioritized districts was done. Each observed  landslide was recorded with the date of its occurrence in Google Earth environment. These landslides were further analysed as pre and post earthquake landslides.</gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:abstract>
         <gmd:purpose>
            <gco:CharacterString>The purpose of the inventory is to record pre and post earthquake  landslides in the 14  priority districts.</gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:purpose>
